    "text": "Swahwilc man swa on sunnand\u00e6g o\u00f0\u00f0e on niht acenned bi\u00f0, orsorglice leof\u00e6\u00f0 he, & bi\u00f0 f\u00e6gger.\nGif he on monand\u00e6g o\u00f0\u00fee on niht acenned bi\u00f0, he bi\u00f0 acweald fram mannum, lewde swa cl\u00e6roc swe\u00feer\nGif he on tiwesd\u00e6g bi\u00f0 acenned o\u00fe\u00f0e on \u00f0a niht, se bi\u00f0 \u00e6werd on his life, & bi\u00f0 man & \u00f0w\u00e6re.\nGif he bi\u00f0 on wodnesdeig o\u00fe\u00f0e on da niht acenned, he bi\u00f0 scarp & biter & swi\u00f0e w\u00e6r on his wordum.\nGif he bi\u00f0 acenned on \u00feurresd\u00e6g o\u00fe\u00f0e on \u00fea niht, he bi\u00f0 swi\u00f0e gesibsum & w\u00e6le\u00f0i, & wel geweaxe\u00fe, &\nGif he bi\u00f0 acenned on frigendeg o\u00f0\u00fee on \u00f0a niht, we bi\u00f0 awerget fam mannum, & he bi\u00f0 disicreafti, &\nGif he bi\u00f0 acenned on saternesd\u00e6g o\u00fe\u00f0e on \u00f0a niht, his d\u00e6de beo\u00f0 franlica, & he bi\u00f0 ealdorman, swa",
